Sooty Chimneys for Sunrise (version 0.6.0)

A port of Sooty Chimneys 1.3.5 by mortuusars.
Original source: https://github.com/mortuusars/sootychimneys
Original licence: MIT

Ported to Horizon by lavoide, and to Sunrise by arismoko: the blocks' behaviour is re-implemented
in Rust on Sunrise's mod API (no Java code is included). The data in data/, the models, textures
and translations in assets/ and icon.png are the original release's. This port is distributed
under the original's licence (MIT); the licence text is in LICENSE.
